{"4964240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RE:DREAM", "steam_appid": 4964240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>!!Disclaimer!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an visual art project. It explores the game as a platform for presenting and experiencing photographs that were inspired by using the game itself as a tool for building worlds. Gameplay is as simple as it gets; the focus lies on worldbuilding. Please don't consider this as a finished Game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Answer to the Dream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;3 Worlds, each holding a clue to what brought you into the dream. Every step is an intuitive decision, a dreamlike wandering. You only know the dream, in which you will get closer to the self that has not yet been discovered. When light interacts with a surface, information is transmitted. It's yours to perceive.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RE:DREAM</strong> is a walking simulator in which the player discovers photographs connected to each character. This project is closely connected to photography and uses photogrammetry to bring real-life characters into the game. Every world was first built inside the game — <i>then rebuilt in real life, as a set</i>, to photograph each character within it. <i>Through this, the game becomes a bridge: the characters step out of the dream and into our reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964240/extras/2e2558196f1fda34e11aeaa4d3f78a1e.avif?t=1786617361\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964240/extras_big/2e2558196f1fda34e11aeaa4d3f78a1e.webp?t=1786617361 width=1560 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p 